# Enemy lasers always show

Laser lines from **either** player must remain visible to everyone.

- Draw all `laserLines` on the view board and visible neighbor peeks (owner color). Do **not** hide opponent lasers for “fairness,” performance, fog-of-war, or invisible kits.
- Warning strip + solid flash stay; both sides see enemy lasers the same way they see their own.
- Collision already skips friendly fire (`laser.owner` / same army). Visibility is separate — enemies still see the beams.
- Perf / draw-path work must not cull enemy lasers. If you throttle FX, keep laser draws.
